BLIND NUMBERS: braids   (referee, step 1; written before opening any file of Noon's)
Program: braid.c (gcc -O3 -march=native, binary braid_n), driver run.sh, check look.py. All double precision, splitmix64 random numbers.
Columns: step threads wet rough maxshare rough_wetcells | means over the last 10,000 steps (sampled every 100; 2,000 steps for D): threads wet rough maxshare
threads/wet/rough as defined in the brief, on rows 64..191, measured on the bed after that many steps with the water routed over that bed.
rough = over ALL cells of rows 64..191; rough_wetcells = the same over cells with Q > 0.224 only. maxshare = mean over rows of max_i Q / sum_i Q.

